    summary """
        Same host and tree: 156 workspace tests passed against the forked rbit, formatting clean, all-target Clippy with warnings denied clean after replacing two chunks_exact calls with as_chunks, release binary built, 10 preview tests passed. The fork itself is a path dependency outside the workspace members, so its own test suite was not run; one dead-code allowance was added in it.
